# ========================================================
# CINEMATIC DEVELOPER PORTFOLIO — ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ========================================================
#
# When deploying to Vercel via GitHub:
# 1. In your Vercel Dashboard, go to your Project > Settings > Environment Variables.
# 2. Add each of the three variables below for Production, Preview, and Development.
#
# EmailJS Client Credentials:
# Free signup at https://www.emailjs.com/
# Template placeholders expected: {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{subject}}, {{message}}

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
